# Kit-local overrides: the parent repo .gitignore has a global `*.txt` rule and ignores
# checkpoints/, which would silence our committed evidence + reproduce path. Re-include the
# files a fresh clone NEEDS (RUN_LOGs = single source of truth; requirements-real = reproduce).
!requirements-real.txt
!requirements.txt
!**/RUN_LOG_*.txt
!DEMO_DAY.md
